Subject: [PATCH] fixup! feat(v2): add C17a deterministic fee-backed UTXO
 expiry and cleaning-crew validation

Give the C17a native coinstats fixture its actual OP_TRUE branch witness, matching the output commitment. Preserve expiration, fee-share and undo assertions. Focused coinstatsindex suite passes all6cases.

Tier: V2
---
 src/test/coinstatsindex_tests.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/test/coinstatsindex_tests.cpp b/src/test/coinstatsindex_tests.cpp
index 5bfd1f6ce8..3ddb0cc419 100644
--- a/src/test/coinstatsindex_tests.cpp
+++ b/src/test/coinstatsindex_tests.cpp
@@ -62,6 +62,9 @@ struct CoinStatsIndexTestAccess {
             ordinary.vin.resize(1);
             ordinary.vin[0].prevout = funding_op;
             ordinary.vin[0].nFlags = 1;
+            lotus::v2::BranchWitness witness;
+            witness.script.assign(script.begin(), script.end());
+            ordinary.vin[0].vWitnesses = {std::move(witness)};
             output.value = 10000;
             ordinary.vout.push_back(CTxOut::FromV2Output(output));
         }
